  "rows": [
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "あ～、ちなみに俺も、参加するつもりなんで。\nはざまさんを放っておけないし……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "山下 次郎"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_09_j:step-3:text",
        "step_id": 3,
        "step_index": 2,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_09_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_09_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 46,
          "target_step_index": 2
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ほう。いいのかい？　山下サン。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "葛之葉 雨彦"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_09_j:step-4:text",
        "step_id": 4,
        "step_index": 3,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_09_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_09_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 46,
          "target_step_index": 3
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "お前さんも言っていた通り、こいつは\n一筋縄じゃあいかないライブになりそうだぜ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "葛之葉 雨彦"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_09_j:step-5:text",
        "step_id": 5,
        "step_index": 4,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_09_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_09_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 46,
          "target_step_index": 4
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "いや、そうなんだけど……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "山下 次郎"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_09_j:step-6:text",
        "step_id": 6,
        "step_index": 5,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_09_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_09_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 46,
          "target_step_index": 5
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "だからこそ、若い連中じゃなくて、\nおじさんが出向くべきかなぁと思って。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "山下 次郎"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_09_j:step-7:text",
        "step_id": 7,
        "step_index": 6,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_09_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_09_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 46,
          "target_step_index": 6
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "俺がこのメンツに呼びかけたのも、\nそういう理由だったりするのよね。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "山下 次郎"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_09_j:step-8:text",
        "step_id": 8,
        "step_index": 7,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_09_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_09_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 46,
          "target_step_index": 7
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "次郎、さすが！\n優しい、冴えてる、いいこと言う！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "渡辺 みのり"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_09_j:step-11:text",
        "step_id": 11,
        "step_index": 10,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_09_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_09_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 46,
          "target_step_index": 10
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "俺たちには、年の功があるからね♪\nこっちだって、一筋縄ではいかないよ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "渡辺 みのり"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_09_j:step-12:text",
        "step_id": 12,
        "step_index": 11,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_09_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_09_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 46,
          "target_step_index": 11
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "先輩方はやる気満々だ。\nんじゃ、最後にくずのはは？　不参加にしとく？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "山下 次郎"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_09_j:step-15:text",
        "step_id": 15,
        "step_index": 14,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_09_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_09_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 46,
          "target_step_index": 14
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "まさか。このライブに参加すりゃ、\n相手の陣地にも入れそうだしな。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "葛之葉 雨彦"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_09_j:step-16:text",
        "step_id": 16,
        "step_index": 15,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_09_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_09_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 46,
          "target_step_index": 15
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "俺にとっても絶好の機会だ。喜んで参加するぜ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "葛之葉 雨彦"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_09_j:step-17:text",
        "step_id": 17,
        "step_index": 16,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_09_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_09_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 46,
          "target_step_index": 16
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "……決まりだな。\nこのあやしいライブ、自分たちで受けてたとう！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "信玄 誠司"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_09_j:step-20:text",
        "step_id": 20,
        "step_index": 19,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_09_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_09_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 46,
          "target_step_index": 19
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "おー！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "全員"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_09_j:step-23:text",
        "step_id": 23,
        "step_index": 22,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_09_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_09_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 46,
          "target_step_index": 22
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "そしたら、プロデューサーちゃんに連絡入れますか。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "山下 次郎"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_09_j:step-26:text",
        "step_id": 26,
        "step_index": 25,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_09_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_09_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 46,
          "target_step_index": 25
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "……もしもし、●●●●プロデューサーちゃん。\n今ちょっと話せる？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "山下 次郎"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_09_j:step-33:text",
        "step_id": 33,
        "step_index": 32,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_09_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_09_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 46,
          "target_step_index": 32
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "実はさ、さっき事務所でプロデューサーちゃんと\nけんがしてた話、聞いちゃってたんだよね。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "山下 次郎"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_09_j:step-34:text",
        "step_id": 34,
        "step_index": 33,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_09_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_09_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 46,
          "target_step_index": 33
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "あの、元・男極の主催者から\nライブのお誘いが来てるってやつ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "山下 次郎"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_09_j:step-35:text",
        "step_id": 35,
        "step_index": 34,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_09_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_09_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 46,
          "target_step_index": 34
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "いや～、盗み聞きしちゃってホントゴメン。\nあれって、315プロ的には断る感じなんだよね？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "山下 次郎"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_09_j:step-36:text",
        "step_id": 36,
        "step_index": 35,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_09_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_09_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 46,
          "target_step_index": 35
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "choice",
      "source_text": "今も賢君と\n話し合っていました",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "none",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": ""
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
